    {
      "id": "U5U-READ-1",
      "paper": "review",
      "title": "Ben the Star Player",
      "text": "Ben is an outstanding baseball player on our school team. Last year, a bad loss almost made the team panic. But Ben stayed calm. In fact, he believed that hard work is the main factor of success. After class, he did research on famous pitchers and copied their skills. He was patient and never gave up, even when his arm was in great pain. To him, the letters on his shirt stand for honor. This year, Ben can pitch the ball very fast, and he helped the team win again. The whole school took action to cheer for him. It did not matter that he once failed. What matters is that he recovered and became a star. Ben's story shows that patience and skill can help anyone stand out."
    }
  ],
